327
00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:37.340
On the one hand we have Non-Rapid Eye Movement sleep

328
00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:38.963
or Non-REM sleep for short.

329
00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:43.230
And Non-REM sleep has been further subdivided

330
00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:45.853
into four separate stages, in fact,

331
00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:51.230
unimaginatively called stages one through four,

332
00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:54.290
we're a creative bunch clearly are sleep researchers.

333
00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:56.150
Decreasing in the depth of sleep.

334
00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:57.740
So stages three and four

335
00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:00.800
are those really deep stages of restorative sleep.

336
00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:03.610
That's what your sort of sleep tracker would say,

337
00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:06.963
that's deep sleep stages, one and two, the light sleep.

338
00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:09.450
And then on the other hand,

339
00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:12.983
we have rapid eye movement sleep or REM sleep.

340
00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:16.420
Named not after the popular Michael Stipe band

