00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:17.870
for the 1980s.

342
00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:22.070
But after these strange horizontal shuttling eye movements

343
00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:25.220
that occur under the eyelid, as you're in this stage.

344
00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:29.620
And REM sleep is the stage during which we principally dream

345
00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:32.030
and that's where you have your most sort of florid,

346
00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:36.393
most narrative hallucinogenic, emotional sort of dreams.

347
00:15:37.246 --> 00:15:40.170
And it turns out that those two types of sleep,

348
00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:44.900
Non-REM and REM will play out in this incredible battle

349
00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:48.340
for brain domination throughout the night.

350
00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:53.340
And that sort of cerebral war is going to be won and lost

351
00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:57.230
every 90 minutes and then replayed every 90 minutes,

352
00:15:57.230 --> 00:15:58.750
at least in humans.

