00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:35.090
And instead you get much more rapid eye movement sleep,

365
00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.730
particularly in the last couple of hours.

366
00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:39.660
And it's not just important

367
00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:42.370
to sort of understand one's sleep,

