01:35:28.910 --> 01:35:32.720
and it's genetically hardwired drop in your alertness.

2097
01:35:32.720 --> 01:35:33.993
It's sort of, you know,

2098
01:35:33.993 --> 01:35:37.940
that you're around the boardroom table after lunch

